<title>USA: US CFTC to wait for exchange coffee stock report.</title>
<headline>US CFTC to wait for exchange coffee stock report.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Futures Trading Commission will wait for a report from the Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange on errors in reporting coffee stocks made at one warehouse before taking further action, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;The exchange is doing what they are expected to do as a self-regulatory organization,&quot; commission spokesman David Gary said Thursday. &quot;We will await the results of their investigation and review them accordingly.&quot;</p>
<p>Earlier, the exchange said it would investigate the errors, but said it had no evidence that any market manipulation occurred. --Aaron Pressman, 202-898-8312</p>
